id: SAVE14-3
package: fandhe-workshop-contract
test: storage_contract
target: crates/contract/src/storage.rs
find:     b.is_ascii_alphanumeric() || matches!(b, b'.' | b'_' | b'-')
replace:     b.is_ascii_alphanumeric() || matches!(b, b'.' | b'_' | b'-' | b'/')
expect-fail: render_parse_roundtrip_and_injective
expect-fail: pack_prefix_does_not_reach_other_scope_or_pack
note: 区間の / を符号化しない（区間の数が崩れ、接頭辞が別の配信先・別の教材の鍵に届く）
